/*
 * wallet-connector-stale-note.compact — no circuit; pointer only.
 * Official WalletConnectedAPI (https://docs.midnight.network/api-reference/dapp-connector/type-aliases/WalletConnectedAPI)
 * shows submitTransaction(tx) with no payFees option. payFees is on makeTransfer, makeIntent,
 * balanceUnsealedTransaction, and balanceSealedTransaction.
 * Upstream midnight-docs#1569 reports published pages that still put payFees on submitTransaction,
 * use capitalized Preview/PreProd network IDs, and omit apiVersion on selectWallet.
 * Compact has no wallet-connector API. This file only pins the known gap for builders.
 * LOCAL-TRUE. No on-chain deploy is claimed. Does not fix the public docs, indexer, or node.
 *
 * Upstream: https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-docs/issues/1569
 * Pins: Compact ~0.31.1 / language ~0.23, midnight-js 4.1.1, DApp Connector 4.0.1, proof-server 8.1.0.
 *
 * Built by @kshot9000 https://x.com/kshot9000
 * Email: kshot9000@gmail.com
 * Cardano donation: addr1q8hnl6vl5a6k3rw3n5g3jtte696zcl76kfatzv7gpswa9r0dj7fma6klq55y4ffm7tf0em09udnyhuk4ah92pl5x9jpqjae44v
 * Teams: @midnightntwrk @MidnightNtwrk @midnightfdn @Cardano @InputOutputHK @cardano-foundation
 */

pragma language_version >= 0.22 && <= 0.23;

import CompactStandardLibrary;

